---
import ContentLayout from "@/layouts/ContentLayout.astro";
import Breadcrumb from "@/components/ui/Breadcrumb.astro";
---

<ContentLayout
  meta={{
    title: "About",
    description:
      "Why Qinobee exists: helping institutions connect student success and career programmes.",
    canonical: "/about",
  }}
>
  <Breadcrumb items={[{ name: "Home", href: "/" }, { name: "About" }]} />

  <h1>About Qinobee</h1>

  <p>
    Qinobee started from a simple observation. Institutions pour real care into
    helping students succeed, yet the work is often held back by disconnected
    tools. A career team here, a mentoring spreadsheet there, a scholarship
    inbox somewhere else. Each does its job, but none of them talk to one
    another.
  </p>

  <p>
    We build the connective tissue. Our platform brings career, mentoring,
    internship, scholarship, student life and exchange programmes onto shared
    foundations, so information is entered once and understood everywhere.
  </p>

  <h2>What we believe</h2>

  <p>
    Student success is a team sport. The people who advise, mentor and place
    students deserve tools that reduce busywork rather than add to it, and
    leaders deserve a clear view of what is genuinely working. When records are
    connected, both become possible without anyone spending an afternoon
    stitching spreadsheets together.
  </p>

  <h2>How we work</h2>

  <p>
    We favour clarity over cleverness. Features earn their place by making a
    real task easier, and every programme should be able to shape the platform
    to fit the way it already works. We would rather ship something plain that
    people use every day than something impressive that gathers dust.
  </p>

  <p>
    If that resonates, we would love to show you around.
    <a href="/request-demo">Request a demo</a> and see how the pieces fit
    together.
  </p>
</ContentLayout>
